  "complete_original_caption_text": "\\caption{A depiction of $f(L_5)$, or $15$ cycles in $Q_+^5$ where each edge is used two times. The vertex labels correspond to their binary representations as length $5$ Boolean vectors, e.g. $15$ is the vertex $(0, 1, 1, 1, 1)$.}",
